G2 -- is f_DM prior-driven?  (RC41 overlap, actual SED + gas)
======================================================================================================================
  Delta_prior = log M_bar,fit - log(M* + M_gas): median -0.100 dex (n = 38); Spearman rho(delta_flat, Delta_prior) = -0.02 (p = 0.894)
  Theil-Sen slope of delta_flat on Delta_prior -0.019; z-slope of delta_flat after removing it: +0.202 [+0.138, +0.267] (n = 38)
  -> prior-driven (|rho| >= 0.3 and p < 0.05): no

